{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213420","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213420","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1521342001:0":{"text":"이틀 후면 물안개 영지에서 철수한다고? 설마...","source_cn":"这两天就要从水泽营地撤走？不是真的吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60045ED8E4CF2EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521342002:0":{"text":"왜? 떠나려고 하니까 섭섭해?","source_cn":"怎么，你还想留在这里不成？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A5A5378FA41C4A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521342003:0":{"text":"응. 오래 주둔했으니 조금은 아쉽지.","source_cn":"是啊。在这驻扎了这么久，多少都有点舍不得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA76A1F9ECFC314BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521342004:0":{"text":"게다가 전쟁도 끝났으니까, 루나애니 친구를 사귀고 싶어.","source_cn":"而且战争好不容易才结束，我还想多交几个兽人朋友呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x501C600F2BFF4F96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521342005:0":{"text":"루나애니랑 친구를? 미쳤어?","source_cn":"和兽人交朋友？你脑子出问题了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFF5305021996D49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521342006:0":{"text":"루나애니 좀 귀엽지 않아? 동물 같은 귀랑 꼬리도 있고, 어쩌면 복슬복슬한 발톱이 있을지도 몰라!","source_cn":"你不觉得有些兽人长得很可爱吗？有动物一样的耳朵和尾巴，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7C7D8BB35887A95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521342007:0":{"text":"우리 집 강아지보다 더 털결이 좋을 수도 있어.","source_cn":"不知道他们的毛摸起来会不会比我家狗的更光滑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F61604EB4FC605E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521342008:0":{"text":"그럼 아쿠보르인을 사랑할 수 있나요?","source_cn":"那么，你会爱上雅库伯尔人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA78A8CF8C39A46E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521342009:0":{"text":"오, 귀여운 루나애니 아가씨네.","source_cn":"哇哦，一个可爱的兽人小姑娘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25906A7D542A91D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521342010:0":{"text":"어디 보자... 루나애니를 사랑하는 것도 나쁘진 않겠지. 아쿠보르의 여자 루나애니들은 다들 강하니까 같이 사냥도 갈 수 있고.","source_cn":"让我想想……爱上兽人应该也没什么不好的吧。雅库伯尔的女...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08EF02A7323BD68B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521342011:0":{"text":"아, 사냥... 사냥이 분명 군대에서 당직 서는 것보다 재미있을 거야!","source_cn":"哎呀，打猎……打猎肯定比在军队里值班有意思多了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x230FC8C08C750061","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521342012:0":{"text":"...완전히 미쳤네.","source_cn":"……你真是彻底疯了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32EC2BE9FBFDD6A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿瑞":{"text":"아레스","source":"阿瑞","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:吕科墨":{"text":"리코모","source":"吕科墨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"갈라","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}